/td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D2BF0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D2E50"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000003DBE2640"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000003DBE49C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000003DBE23E0"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000003DBE2180"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D0760"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CE610" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D0E80"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CDD10" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear Agency Partner,</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CFCD0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D0170" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CDAB0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D10E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for reaching out to us via the Qantas Agency Connect Contact Us form.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CFF30"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CFA90">We are currently looking into your enquiry and aim to provide you with an update within the next 24 hours.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CF980"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CF740">Your Qantas Reference Number is:&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D3EF0">QFSF<mark data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8C7860">0000</mark></strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CF630"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CF060">If your customer’s travel is within the next 72 hours, please contact your local Qantas Agency Connect team directly to ensure that their travel journey is not interrupted.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CDF70"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8CA7D0">For more information on Qantas NDC,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/agencyconnect/au/en/qantas-ndc/help-and-support/qantas-ndc-booking-and-technical-support.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000003DBE2FA0" style="color: rgb(223, 0, 0); border: 0px;">click here</a>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D7B78A0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8C6DD0">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8C60E0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D7B7DF0"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D2990">Qantas NDC Escalation Support</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D7B7CE0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018263270">Qantas Airways Limited</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D4AD0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D5670" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000003DBE1CC0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000003DBE1F20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000003D8D58B0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000003DBE1800" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 10